            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3><span>Tea on the Lawn</span></h3>
<p>Complement your visit to Billings Estate National Historic Site with Tea on the Lawn. Enjoy tea and freshly baked goods alongside our beautiful gardens. Heritage staff are happy to highlight the unique history of the estate, making Tea on the Lawn a memorable addition to your museum experience.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p>Wednesdays, Thursdays, Fridays and Sundays from<strong>&nbsp;May&nbsp;15,&nbsp;2026&nbsp;to August&nbsp;30,&nbsp;2026</strong>&nbsp;with seatings at 10:30 am, 12:30 pm and 2:30 pm. <strong>Reservations are&nbsp;required.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>
<h4><strong>2026 menu and prices</strong></h4>
<p><strong>Three-tier service for one:&nbsp;$21.95&nbsp;</strong>(taxes included)&nbsp;<br>Pot of tea; finger sandwiches; scone with butter and jam; assorted desserts. Admission to the museum for one visitor is included.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
